# Antigravity GUI Installation & Setup Guide (English)

[한국어 가이드](./antigravity.ko.md) · [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}/releases/latest)

Install the Claire Bible `claire` plugin in **Antigravity GUI** and connect the standalone global `claire` OAuth 2.1 MCP server without losing your server configuration on future plugin upgrades.

---

## Before You Start (1 Minute)

1. Sign in to your **Claire Bible** web interface.
2. Open **LLM provider settings** (`/account/providers`) and switch **Extraction mode** to **`Agent Client (client)`**.
3. Keep **MCP Settings** (`/account/mcp`) open in your browser to copy the quick setup prompt or download `mcp_config.json`.

---

## Method 1 (Recommended): Paste Once in Antigravity Chat

Antigravity installs the `claire` plugin under `~/.gemini/config/plugins/claire` and safely merges `"claire"` into your global `~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json` without overwriting existing servers.

1. On Claire Bible **`/account/mcp`**, locate **Official Agent Marketplace (GitHub)** and click **Copy** next to **Antigravity quick setup prompt**.
   - Starting directly from GitHub? Copy below and replace `<your-claire-server>`:
   ```text
   Download claire-antigravity-v{{VERSION}}.zip from the latest Release of
   https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}, verify SHA256SUMS, install it into
   ~/.gemini/config/plugins/claire, and merge claire (https://<your-claire-server>/mcp) into
   ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json while preserving existing entries.
   ```
2. Open **Antigravity**, click **`+ New Conversation`**, paste, and send.
   - When asked to confirm writing under `~/.gemini/config/`, pick **`1 Yes, allow this time`** and click **`Submit`**.
3. **Sign In to Claire Bible (OAuth 2.1)**:
   - Open **`Customizations`** -> **`Installed`** -> **`MCP Servers`** -> **`claire`**.
   - Sign in through your browser and approve both **`readonly`** and **`write`** scopes.

---

## Method 2 (Point-and-Click): Manual Setup

1. Download **`claire-antigravity-v{{VERSION}}.zip`** from [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}/releases/latest) and unzip it to obtain the **`claire`** folder.
2. Move **`claire`** into your Antigravity plugins directory (`~/.gemini/config/plugins/claire/plugin.json`).
   - macOS Finder: `Command + Shift + G` -> `~/.gemini/config`
   - Windows File Explorer: `%USERPROFILE%\.gemini\config`
   - Linux File Manager: `Ctrl + H` -> `.gemini` -> `config`
3. In `~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json` (downloadable from Claire `/account/mcp` if you have no existing servers yet), merge `"claire"` under `"mcpServers"`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "claire": {
      "url": "https://<your-claire-server>/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

4. In Antigravity **`Customizations -> Installed -> MCP Servers -> claire`**, complete OAuth 2.1 sign-in (`readonly` and `write`).

