## Handling Permission Prompts on First Run (`Allow using this MCP tool?`)

On first tool call, Antigravity displays **`Allow using this MCP tool?`** for `claire/<tool_name>` with four choices:

1. **`1 Yes, allow this time`**
2. **`2 Yes, and always allow in this conversation`**
3. **`3 Yes, and always allow`**
4. **`4 No (tell the agent what to do instead)`**

- **Personal-KB ingest, extraction & query tools (`extract_stage`, `extract_spec`, `extract_queue`, `extract_claim`, `extract_read`, `extract_submit`, `kb_list`, `entity_search`, `graph_neighbors`, etc.)**: choose **`3 Yes, and always allow`** -> **`Submit`** so multi-step extraction completes smoothly.
- **Shared-KB contribution (`claire/contrib_submit`)**: keep **`1 Yes, allow this time`** if you want explicit confirmation per contribution.
- Review or revoke permissions anytime under **`Settings -> Permission Grants`**.

