<details>
<summary>CLI & Advanced Users (.tar.gz, SHA256SUMS, agy CLI)</summary>

1. Verify checksum and extract:
   ```bash
   curl -fsSLO "https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}/releases/download/v{{VERSION}}/claire-antigravity-v{{VERSION}}.tar.gz"
   curl -fsSLO "https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}/releases/download/v{{VERSION}}/SHA256SUMS"
   sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS --ignore-missing
   mkdir -p ~/.gemini/config/plugins
   tar -xzf claire-antigravity-v{{VERSION}}.tar.gz -C ~/.gemini/config/plugins
   agy plugin validate --strict ~/.gemini/config/plugins/claire
   ```
2. Add `"claire": {"url": "https://<your-claire-server>/mcp"}` inside `~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json` under `"mcpServers"`.

</details>
